#: includes/class-crumbsignal-admin.php:90
msgid ""
"With this on, CrumbSignal shows no banner and runs your analytics, marketing "
"and preferences scripts for every visitor without asking. It still respects "
"a choice a visitor already made, and Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track "
"if those options below are on. Use it only where consent is not required for "
"your visitors; you remain responsible for complying with the law that "
"applies to you. A common use is keeping bots out of analytics with "
"GuardRelay without showing anyone a banner. (To remove CrumbSignal entirely, "
"including its script handling, turn off \"Enable the cookie banner\" above "
"instead.)"
msgstr ""

